                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really wanted to like this and for the first 40 minutes but then I was hit with a game-breaking bug leaving me unable to progress or complete the game. This was apparently 'updated' in 2016 after the game's release but was clearly either not or was, but was broken in future updates to graphics cards. Either way, the dev hasn't updated the game since the year it came out and thus, said bug remains unfixable. I really enjoyed the concept and was drawn to it due to it's weirdness but it being impossible to finish leaves a really sour taste in my mouth. Fix your game.",
